# A pastel blanket burrito (1.2.0) drawn OVER the napping loaf: blanket-1 over duck frame `sit`,
# blanket-2 over `loaf-2` (its back a pixel higher as it breathes in). Both go at stage (4,20)
# (the duck frame at the usual (4,8)). It hugs the loaf one pixel out; only the tail tip, the head
# with its closed eye and the beak stick out. Lilac with cream dots, a pink trim, lit top-left.
name: blanket
size: 27x19
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  H #ddd2fb
  L #b9a6ea
  l #8f7cc8
  C #fff1d6
  P #f7b8cf
  p #d98aa8

